    "enUS": {
      "description": "When I first administered the elixir, {name}, I could tell that one or two applications would not satiate your appetite. Even now, I can see the hunger in your eyes. The concoction has addictive properties of which, seemingly, the most strong of will cannot resist.\n\nSo be it! Should you require more of the lung juice cocktail, venture back into the wasteland and find for me three blasted boar lungs, two scorpok pincers, and one basilisk brain.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Blasted Boar Lung",
          "type": "item"
        },
        {
